WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.300
-We have exactly five shows left

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.000
before we go on Christmas break,
which means it's time for

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.334
that beloved
"Tonight Show" tradition.

00:00:05.334 --> 00:00:09.100
It's time for "12 Days of
Christmas Sweaters."

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.400
-♪ 12 Days of
Christmas Sweaters ♪

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:16.701
♪ Five days left ♪

00:00:16.701 --> 00:00:21.868
-That's right -- every show
between now and Christmas,

00:00:21.868 --> 00:00:23.934
we'll be giving
one lucky audience member

00:00:23.934 --> 00:00:26.734
an mm-mm-mm Christmas sweater

00:00:26.734 --> 00:00:28.534
from the "Countdown to
Christmas Cabinet."

00:00:28.534 --> 00:00:32.601
Since there are five shows left,
let's open door number 5.

00:00:32.601 --> 00:00:33.634
Where do we go?
Where do we go?

00:00:33.634 --> 00:00:35.567
-Right here.
-Alright, go for it, bud.

00:00:35.567 --> 00:00:37.868
Whenever you're ready.
Oh, my gosh!

00:00:37.868 --> 00:00:40.133
Wow! I don't know what that is.

00:00:40.133 --> 00:00:41.300
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:44.868
Is that a sweater?

00:00:44.868 --> 00:00:46.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:49.434 --> 00:00:51.767
I don't know what the heck --
-Turn it around?

00:00:51.767 --> 00:00:53.634
-Yeah.

00:00:53.634 --> 00:00:54.934
That's the back of it there.

00:00:54.934 --> 00:00:57.934
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Yeah.

00:00:57.934 --> 00:00:58.934
-Wow.

00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:00.734
Alright. Wow!
-Wow.

00:01:00.734 --> 00:01:03.334
-Oh, my gosh. This is heavy.

00:01:03.334 --> 00:01:05.234
Alright, now let's see who's
going home -- Wow!

00:01:05.234 --> 00:01:06.634
This is 100 pounds.

00:01:06.634 --> 00:01:08.100
Let's see who's going home
with tonight's sweater.

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:09.167
Everyone look at your
seat number, okay?

00:01:09.167 --> 00:01:11.567
If I call your number,
come on down.

00:01:11.567 --> 00:01:13.167
Quest, can I get
a drumroll, please?

00:01:13.167 --> 00:01:14.300
[ Drumroll ]
Who wants this sweater?

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:16.300
This is a...
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:20.868 --> 00:01:23.667
314!

00:01:23.667 --> 00:01:27.367
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:01:27.367 --> 00:01:28.968
Come on down.

00:01:33.434 --> 00:01:34.901
Come on!

00:01:34.901 --> 00:01:37.434
It's getting heavy.

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:42.667
Come on!

00:01:42.667 --> 00:01:44.634
Hey, come on,
we got a show to do.

00:01:44.634 --> 00:01:46.367
Come on, get over here.

00:01:46.367 --> 00:01:48.734
Here, go on over there.

00:01:48.734 --> 00:01:50.133
Gosh, this sweater's heavy.

00:01:50.133 --> 00:01:52.100
You take your time
with that one.

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:53.734
Gosh. Welcome.
-Oh, sorry.

00:01:53.734 --> 00:01:54.901
-Thank you for coming.
Thank you for being here.

00:01:54.901 --> 00:01:56.067
What is your name?
-Marcella.

00:01:56.067 --> 00:01:58.667
-Marcella, where are you from?
-California.

00:01:58.667 --> 00:02:02.133
-Hey!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:02.133 --> 00:02:05.334
Marcella, this is perfect
for California.

00:02:05.334 --> 00:02:06.400
-Yeah.

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:09.000
-Everyone in L.A.
will be wearing these.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:10.501
Do you have anything
like this at home?

00:02:10.501 --> 00:02:13.267
-Nope.
-Oh! Nothing even close?

00:02:13.267 --> 00:02:14.601
-Uh, no.
-Yeah.

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:16.400
Marcella, would you try this
on for us tonight?

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:17.501
-Yeah.
-Alright, cool.

00:02:17.501 --> 00:02:19.300
Roots, can I get some music?
♪♪

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:21.767
We need some help here.

00:02:21.767 --> 00:02:23.934
Alright, good luck.

00:02:23.934 --> 00:02:25.334
I feel your head.

00:02:25.334 --> 00:02:26.868
I feel your head in there.
Okay, good.

00:02:26.868 --> 00:02:29.067
Marcel-- Oh! Can you breathe?

00:02:29.067 --> 00:02:30.968
-Yeah.
-Yes, you're good. Alright.

00:02:30.968 --> 00:02:32.634
Sorry.
-I'm, like, nervous.

00:02:32.634 --> 00:02:34.100
-No, that's alright.
Oh, yeah, good, Marcella.

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:36.200
Yeah, gorgeous.
-Oh!

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:38.467
-No, this is perfect.
Marcella, turn around.

00:02:38.467 --> 00:02:39.634
This is good.

00:02:39.634 --> 00:02:43.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:47.100
Oh, my gosh.
That is unbelievably gorgeous.

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.100
Beautiful.
Thank you so much, Marcella.

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:50.934
Congratulations.
Thank you very much.

00:02:50.934 --> 00:02:54.367
-I just had an
ugly Christmas sweater, um...

00:02:54.367 --> 00:02:57.100
-You just had an
ugly Christmas sweater party?

00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:58.234
-Party.
-Yeah.

00:02:58.234 --> 00:02:59.434
-And it's too late.
-Yeah, too late now.

00:02:59.434 --> 00:03:00.634
But you got to go back.

00:03:00.634 --> 00:03:03.133
But you have this to go to
the next one.

00:03:03.133 --> 00:03:05.167
Have another party next week.
Thank you very much.

00:03:05.167 --> 00:03:07.100
Congratulations. Thank you.
Good job!

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:10.067
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:03:10.067 --> 00:03:12.767
-Can I have a hug?
-Yeah, of course.

00:03:12.767 --> 00:03:14.634
-Thank you.

00:03:19.534 --> 00:03:23.634
-Fur and glitter and everything.

00:03:23.634 --> 00:03:25.467
Well done, pal.
You rocked that out.

